WEBVTT

00:11:30.085 --> 00:11:32.953
Na zaidi ya hayo,

00:11:32.953 --> 00:11:36.018
Najua kwamba pamoja,

00:11:36.018 --> 00:11:39.966
tunaweza kubadilisha mifumo ya kisheria,

00:11:39.966 --> 00:11:43.135
kiutamaduni na kisiasa

00:11:43.135 --> 00:11:47.906
inayozikanusha haki za wasichana.

00:11:47.906 --> 00:11:52.964
Nasimama hapa leo

00:11:52.964 --> 00:12:00.004
na kutangaza kwamba tunaweza
kuisha ndoa za watoto katika kizazi kimoja.